  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help little Alya recover from brain tumor!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Little Alya is only 5 years old. A very sweet, cheerful and lovable girl. Yet sadly at a very young age, she already suffers from a brain tumor, which requires her to undergo brain surgery. Thankfully, the procedure was successful, and Alya is now recovering. The cost of her operation was covered by a government subsidy, however, the postoperative treatment she must undergo is not.  At the moment, Alya&apos;s parents are at a considerable problem in trying to cover for the expense.</narrative>
  </description>
